  "body_html": "<p>Marechal: sua Tropa tem meia dúzia de membros por padrão. Trate-os como um seguidor com a tag <em>grupo</em> . Todos os valores iniciais desta folha podem mudar durante o jogo.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">A Tropa</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"HP máx.\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">HP máx.</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Armadura\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Armadura</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Dano\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Rolar dano\">Dano</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">O HP começa em 6 cada; a Armadura em 0; o Dano em d6.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">Tags</h3>\n<p>Sua tropa começa com <em>grupo</em>, uma tag concedida pelo seu antecedente, mais 2 outras à sua escolha.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>arqueiros</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>atléticos</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>corajosos</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>astutos</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>devotados</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Começa marcada\"> <span><em>grupo</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>resistentes</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>intimidantes</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>observadores</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>pacientes</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>respeitados</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>furtivos</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>guerreiros</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escreva aqui\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escreva aqui\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escreva aqui\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>excepcionais</em> (requer Heróis até o Fim)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">Instinto</h3>\n<p>Escolha 1.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>Brigar, criar intriga e guardar rancor</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>Apegar-se à tradição e à superstição</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>Ceder aos instintos mais baixos</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>Mandar nos outros</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>Correr riscos desnecessários</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>Passar dos limites</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escreva aqui\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">Custo</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>Escolha 1.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Lealdade</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"Lealdade 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Lealdade 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"Lealdade 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Lealdade 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"Lealdade 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Lealdade 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>Farras, em grupo</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>Reconhecimento público e respeito, honra</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>Riscos corridos, por você, para ajudá-los</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>Vitórias contra inimigos à altura</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>Riquezas ganhas para eles ou para Stonetop</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escreva aqui\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">Inventário</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ ou menos é carga leve; 4–6 ◇ é carga normal; 7–9 ◇ é carga pesada.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>Machadinha</strong>, de ferro (<em>mão</em>, <em>arremesso</em>, x perfurante)</li><li>◇ <strong>Lança</strong>, de ferro (<em>perto</em>, <em>arremesso</em>, x perfurante)</li><li>◇ <strong>Arco e flechas de ferro</strong> (<em>próximo</em>, x perfurante, ○ pouca munição, ○ esgotada)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Escudo</strong> (+1 armadura, +1 Prontidão com 7+ ao Defender)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Peles grossas</strong> (1 armadura, <em>quente</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Capa</strong> (<em>quente</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Suprimentos</strong> (4+Prosperidade usos por membro da tropa)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">Suprimentos</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"Uso 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"Uso 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"Uso 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"Uso 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"Uso 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"Uso 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"Uso 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"Uso 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"Uso 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"Uso 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"Uso 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"Uso 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"Uso 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"Uso 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"Uso 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"Uso 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"Uso 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"Uso 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"Uso 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"Uso 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"Uso 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"Uso 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"Uso 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"Uso 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"Uso 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"Uso 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"Uso 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"Uso 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"Uso 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"Uso 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"Uso 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"Uso 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"Uso 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"Uso 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"Uso 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"Uso 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"Uso 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"Uso 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"Uso 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"Uso 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"Uso 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"Uso 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"Uso 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"Uso 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"Uso 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"Uso 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"Uso 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"Uso 8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Outro equipamento</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">Indivíduos</h3>\n<p>Quando alguém se destacar, dê a essa pessoa um nome, uma tag e um ou mais traços.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traços</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traços\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traços</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traços\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traços</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traços\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traços</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traços\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traços</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traços\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Traços</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"traços\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Nomes:</strong> Aled, Culhwich, Eira, Gerat, Glaw, Harri, Lowri, Mervyn, Nesta</p>\n<p><strong>Tags:</strong> <em>amigo dos bichos, grandalhão, valentão, cínico, beberrão, empolgado, jogador, ganancioso, rabugento, crédulo, galã, honesto, gentil, devasso, miúdo, ingênuo, velho, popular, orgulhoso, novato, imprudente, sem-vergonha, olho vivo, pavio curto</em></p>\n<p><strong>Traços:</strong> filho/irmão/pai/primo/___ de ___, careca, apaixonado por ___, rancor contra ___, odeia ___, idolatra ___, piadista, bagunceiro, falta um olho/dedo/mão/___, sente falta dos filhos, pesadelos, recém-casado, religioso, cicatrizes, magricela, língua afiada, canta, ronca, conta vantagem, sério demais, problemas em casa, assobia, entalha madeira</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notas</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notas\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">Comandar Seguidores</h3>\n<p>Quando você <strong><em>os direciona a fazer um movimento e eles o fazem</em></strong>, role +1 em vez de +ATRIBUTO se alguma das tags deles se aplicar (ou +2 se também forem <em>excepcionais</em>). Se nenhuma tag se aplicar, role +0. Se alguma das tags atrapalhar, role com desvantagem.</p>\n<p>Quando estão <strong><em>sem ordens</em></strong> ou <strong><em>agem por iniciativa própria</em></strong>, o mestre diz o que fazem e como se saem.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">Fortaleça o Vínculo</h3>\n<p>Quando você <strong><em>paga o custo deles</em></strong> e não fez isso recentemente, eles guardam +1 de Lealdade (máx. 3).</p>\n<p>Gaste a Lealdade deles 1 por 1 para que:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Superem o medo para fazer o que você diz</li><li>Resistam a agir por instinto/tags/traços</li><li>Façam algo que não querem fazer (desde que não seja abominável nem suicida)</li></ul>"
}
